{"id":8201492,"docketId":65299301,"caseName":"United States v. Michener","caseNameFull":"United States v. Michener","slug":"united-states-v-michener","docketNumber":"No. 793","dateFiled":"1947-06-02","dateArgued":null,"dateCertGranted":null,"year":1947,"scdbId":"","direction":"","votesMajority":null,"votesMinority":null,"disposition":"","posture":"","syllabus":null,"summary":null,"headnotes":null,"proceduralHistory":null,"attorneys":"W. Marvin Smith argued the cause for the United States. With him on the brief were Acting Solicitor General Washington, Robert S. Erdahl and Irving S. Shapiro. Roger Kent argued the cause and filed a brief for respondent.","natureOfSuit":"","citationCount":17,"judges":"Announced, Below, Controlled, Douglas, Goetz, Morgan, Murphy, Share, That, Tritico, View, Would","jurisdictionType":"","opinions":[{"id":8163429,"type":"majority","typeCode":"020lead","perCuriam":false,"author":"","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":1906,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"majority\">\n<author id=\"ALUy\">\n<em>Per Curiam:</em>\n</author>\n<p id=\"As5\">Reversed. <em>Blockburger </em>v. <em>United States, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"101824\"><a href=\"/opinion/101824/blockburger-v-united-states/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Blockburger v. United States\">284 U. S. 299</a></span>; <em>Albrecht </em>v. <em>United States, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"100977\"><a href=\"/opinion/100977/albrecht-v-united-states/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Albrecht v. United States\">273 U. S. 1</a></span>; <em>Gavieres </em>v. <em>United States, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"97395\"><a href=\"/opinion/97395/gavieres-v-united-states/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gavieres v. United States\">220 U. S. 338</a></span>.</p>\n<judges id=\"ANR\">Mr. Justice Douglas, Mr. Justice Murphy, and Mr. Justice Rutledge share the view of the Circuit Court of Appeals, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1493992\"><a hre